       (3*aC3*aT1*tauC2*(tauC2 - tauC2/E^(TH/tauC2)))/(tauC2 - tauT1) - 
       (3*aC4*aT1*tauC3*(tauC3 - tauC3/E^(TH/tauC3)))/(tauC3 - tauT1) + 
